        {
          "path": "src/contracts/libraries/shadcn/30c4964806cddb026155c6d3126dbe8251b34c34f81640b07b0d59b916343c90/package/library/components/avatar/README.md",
          "snippet": "`release:false`; kein allgemeines Pixel-/Framework-/AT-Zertifikat."
